{"id":"379df91db6a6f0af","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-completion.md","title":"完整一致延伸与句子编码","display":"df-completion — 完整一致延伸与句子编码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-completion","aliases":["20-df-completion"],"display":"df-completion — 完整一致延伸与句子编码","chapter":"10","section":"10.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 10.1.1；§10.2（逻辑一致性与完备延伸的本地展开）","source_pdf_pages":[215,216],"source_printed_pages":[183,184],"depends_on":["[[20-df-pa]]","[[20-df-provable]]","[[20-df-classical-proof-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-completion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-completion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-completion — 完整一致延伸与句子编码"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 10.1.1；§10.2（逻辑一致性与完备延伸的本地展开）"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>215</span><span>216</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>183</span><span>184</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e01ee20e163d443\" href=\"?note=4e01ee20e163d443\" title=\"20-df-pa\">20-df-pa</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ea674d0eb2839a85\" href=\"?note=ea674d0eb2839a85\" title=\"20-df-provable\">20-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8372bbf882660759\" href=\"?note=8372bbf882660759\" title=\"20-df-classical-proof-system\">20-df-classical-proof-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\">\\(T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\\)</span>；固定经典 Hilbert 系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=P_H\">\\(P=P_H\\)</span>，并取逻辑矛盾句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot=((0=0)\\land\\neg(0=0))\">\\(\\bot=((0=0)\\land\\neg(0=0))\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4e01ee20e163d443\" href=\"?note=4e01ee20e163d443\" title=\"20-df-pa\">20-df-pa</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ea674d0eb2839a85\" href=\"?note=ea674d0eb2839a85\" title=\"20-df-provable\">20-df-provable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8372bbf882660759\" href=\"?note=8372bbf882660759\" title=\"20-df-classical-proof-system\">20-df-classical-proof-system</a>。</p>\n<p>固定原先使用的可计算双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\omega\\to\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\">\\(g:\\omega\\to\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\\)</span>；计算性通过上游有限语法树编码解释，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 及其逆均为固定的有效算法。本条及下游衡量理论的计算性和度时均使用该同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow T\\not\\vdash_P\\bot,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Completion}_{PA}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\nPA\\subseteq T\\land\\operatorname{Consistent}(T)\\land\n(\\forall\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\\\n[T\\vdash_P\\theta\\Rightarrow\\theta\\in T])\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\\\n[\\theta\\in T\\lor\\neg\\theta\\in T].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow T\\not\\vdash_P\\bot,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Completion}_{PA}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\nPA\\subseteq T\\land\\operatorname{Consistent}(T)\\land\n(\\forall\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\\\n[T\\vdash_P\\theta\\Rightarrow\\theta\\in T])\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\\\n[\\theta\\in T\\lor\\neg\\theta\\in T].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TheoryCode}(T):=\\{n\\in\\omega:g(n)\\in T\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TheoryCode}(T):=\\{n\\in\\omega:g(n)\\in T\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定可计算双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\omega\\to\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\">\\(g:\\omega\\to\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\\)</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{n:g(n)\\in T\\}\">\\(\\{n:g(n)\\in T\\}\\)</span> 衡量理论的计算性和度。经典逻辑中，推出这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 等价于同时推出某句及其否定，因此单参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Consistent}\">\\(\\operatorname{Consistent}\\)</span> 对任意句子理论都有标准含义。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PA\">\\(PA\\)</span> 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\ne S0\">\\(0\\ne S0\\)</span>，故在包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PA\">\\(PA\\)</span> 的理论上，也可用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=S0\">\\(0=S0\\)</span> 检测不一致。但若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\{0=S0\\}\">\\(T=\\{0=S0\\}\\)</span> 且没有算术公理，取单元素结构、令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为恒等函数便给一个模型；把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=S0\">\\(0=S0\\)</span> 当成任意理论的逻辑矛盾会误判此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>。当前定义保留完整一致延伸的签名，并消除这项额外算术前提。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 10.1.1 与 §10.2 的完整一致延伸；证明系统和矛盾句为本地展开。印刷页 183, 184；PDF 第 215, 216 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-pa","status":"resolved","id":"4e01ee20e163d443","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pa]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"ea674d0eb2839a85","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-classical-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"8372bbf882660759","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-classical-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pa","status":"resolved","id":"4e01ee20e163d443","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pa]]；see [[20-df-provable]]；see [[20-df-classical-proof-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"ea674d0eb2839a85","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pa]]；see [[20-df-provable]]；see [[20-df-classical-proof-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-classical-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"8372bbf882660759","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pa]]；see [[20-df-provable]]；see [[20-df-classical-proof-system]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"P=P_H","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot=((0=0)\\land\\neg(0=0))","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\omega\\to\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow T\\not\\vdash_P\\bot,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Completion}_{PA}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\nPA\\subseteq T\\land\\operatorname{Consistent}(T)\\land\n(\\forall\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\\\n[T\\vdash_P\\theta\\Rightarrow\\theta\\in T])\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\\\n[\\theta\\in T\\lor\\neg\\theta\\in T].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TheoryCode}(T):=\\{n\\in\\omega:g(n)\\in T\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"g:\\omega\\to\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\{n:g(n)\\in T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Consistent}","display":false},{"tex":"PA","display":false},{"tex":"0\\ne S0","display":false},{"tex":"PA","display":false},{"tex":"0=S0","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\{0=S0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"0=S0","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":2569,"backlinks":[{"id":"96aa7c2f3c33ea30","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pa]]；see [[20-df-completion]]；see [[20-df-provable]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"32e788ac089e03ef","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-completion]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。"},{"id":"63a9c41255fee3d1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pa-degree]]；see [[20-df-completion]]；see [[20-thm-pa-dnc]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-completion]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-146","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-completion]] — 章 10；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-146","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-d